{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "A1v2 \u00b7 IDENT BENCH: legs only, isolated pulses",
    "description": "Identification bench (2026-08-31): head modules removed entirely (those joints hold the calibrated stand), legs babble isolated held pulses for the whole run (babble_ticks 999999).  The single question: does A(pitch, hip_pitch) converge to the probe-measured authority?  If not, the identification path has a mechanical bug.",
    "env_target": "microduck",
    "phase_tag": "A1 (first brain)",
    "scaffolds_active": [
      "alpha_stand.onnx via the A2 recovery harness \u2014 drives only while the body is down, with all learning rates zeroed"
    ]
  },
